  "docTitle": "Observability & Failure Drills - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Watch the ShopStream Kafka pipeline like an on-call engineer: consumer lag, throughput, DLQ and under-replicated partitions in Prometheus and Grafana; then run chaos drills (kill a broker, stall a consumer, poison messages, rebalance, replay, hot partition) and learn what you will see and why; finish with pipeline interview questions and scenarios.",
