      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"5\">Level 5 - Interview-ready</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">60 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">Prometheus</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">Grafana</span>\n          <span class=\"chip\">Chaos drills</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Observability &amp; Failure Drills</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">A pipeline you cannot see is a pipeline you cannot trust. After this page you will know the five numbers that tell you a Kafka pipeline is healthy, you will have broken ShopStream on purpose six ways and watched it recover, and you will be able to tell those stories in an interview.</p>\n      "
  },
